WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.525
Assistance can improve performance, but learning needs other evidence.

2
00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:08.550
A correct answer with help shows assisted performance.

3
00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:13.227
A related attempt without that help supplies different evidence.

4
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:18.055
Neither observation alone tells the whole story of learning.
